#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:1
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattleTent"
msgid ""
"I welcome you to the BATTLE TENT\n"
"FALLARBOR SITE!\p"
"I am your guide to the Set KO Tourney!$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到对战帐篷秋叶镇分馆！\p"
"我是淘汰赛的向导！$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:6
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_TakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Now, do you wish to take the challenge\n"
"of a Set KO Tourney?$"
msgstr "那么，你要挑战淘汰赛吗？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:10
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_AwaitAnotherChallenge"
msgid ""
"We await your challenge on\n"
"another occasion!$"
msgstr "我们期待你下次的挑战！$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:14
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainFallarborTent"
msgid ""
"In the FALLARBOR BATTLE TENT,\n"
"we undertake the Set KO Tourney.\p"
"All participants enter with a team of\n"
"three POKéMON.\p"
"The three POKéMON must be lined up\n"
"in the order that they are to appear in.\p"
"During battle, the POKéMON will appear\n"
"one at a time in the preset order.\p"
"Once a POKéMON enters battle, it must\n"
"remain out until the match is decided.\p"
"If a match remains undecided in\n"
"three turns, it goes to judging.\p"
"If you wish to interrupt your challenge,\n"
"please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save, you will not be able\n"
"to continue with your challenge.\p"
"If you pull off the feat of beating\n"
"three TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with a fine prize.$"
msgstr ""
"在秋叶镇对战帐篷，\n"
"我们举办的是淘汰赛。\p"
"所有参赛者都要\n"
"带着3只宝可梦参加。\p"
"这3只宝可梦必须\n"
"按照出场的顺序排好。\p"
"对战中，宝可梦会按照\n"
"预先排好的顺序逐一出场。\p"
"宝可梦一旦出场，\n"
"就必须一直战斗到分出胜负。\p"
"如果3回合内还没有分出胜负，\n"
"就会进入裁判判定。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果不记录，\n"
"就无法继续挑战了。\p"
"如果能连续打败3位训练家，\n"
"我们会送你一份很棒的奖品。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:35
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_SaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Before showing you to the BATTLE\n"
"TENT, I must save. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"带你去对战帐篷之前，\n"
"我必须先记录。可以吗？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:40
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"We offer two levels of challenge,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice?$"
msgstr ""
"我们提供两种挑战等级：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要选哪一种？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:45
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Very well, now select your\n"
"three POKéMON, please.$"
msgstr ""
"很好，那么请选择\n"
"你的3只宝可梦。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:49
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\p"
"When you have made your preparations,\n"
"please do return.$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者！\p"
"你没有参赛所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}不能参加。\p"
"准备好之后，\n"
"请再回来吧。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:59
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"To qualify, you must bring three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\p"
"When you have made your preparations,\n"
"please do return.$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者！\p"
"你没有参赛所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"要参赛，必须带上\n"
"3只不同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}不能参加。\p"
"准备好之后，\n"
"请再回来吧。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:71
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_GuideYouToBattleTent"
msgid ""
"I shall now guide you to\n"
"the BATTLE TENT.$"
msgstr ""
"现在我带你去\n"
"对战帐篷。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:75
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You did not save the game before\n"
"shutting down, did you?\p"
"It is unfortunate, but that has\n"
"resulted in your disqualification\l"
"from your challenge.\p"
"You may, of course, start with a fresh\n"
"challenge.$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者！\p"
"你在关机之前\n"
"没有记录游戏进度吧？\p"
"很遗憾，因为这样，\n"
"你的挑战资格被取消了。\p"
"当然，你可以\n"
"重新开始挑战。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:85
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_BeatThreeTrainers"
msgid ""
"How splendid! You have beaten\n"
"three TRAINERS in succession!$"
msgstr ""
"太精彩了！你连续打败了\n"
"3位训练家！$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:89
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WaitWhileSaveGame"
msgid "Please wait while I save the game.$"
msgstr "我要记录游戏进度，请稍候。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:92
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_PresentYouWithPrize"
msgid ""
"In commemoration of your 3-win streak,\n"
"we present you with this prize.$"
msgstr ""
"为了纪念你的3连胜，\n"
"我们将这份奖品送给你。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:96
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReceivedPrize"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了奖品\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:100
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_BagFullReturnForPrize"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"Your BAG seems to be full.\p"
"I urge you to clear space and\n"
"return for your prize.$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你的背包好像满了。\p"
"请腾出空间\n"
"再回来领取奖品。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:106
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ThankYouWaitWhileSaving"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for participating!\p"
"Please wait while I save the game.$"
msgstr ""
"非常感谢你的参与！\p"
"我要记录游戏进度，请稍候。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:110
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_AwaitAnotherChallenge2"
msgid ""
"We await your challenge on\n"
"another occasion!$"
msgstr "我们期待你下次的挑战！$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:114
msgctxt "FallarborTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_LookingForwardToArrival"
msgid ""
"We have been looking forward to\n"
"your arrival.\p"
"Before I show you to the BATTLE TENT,\n"
"I must save the game. Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"我们一直在期待你的到来。\p"
"带你去对战帐篷之前，\n"
"我必须先记录游戏进度。请稍候。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:120
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattleTent"
msgid ""
"I welcome you to the BATTLE TENT\n"
"VERDANTURF SITE!\p"
"Here, the TRAINER's trust toward\n"
"POKéMON is tested.$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到对战帐篷绿荫镇分馆！\p"
"在这里，考验的是训练家\n"
"对宝可梦的信任。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:126
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_TakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Do you wish to take the VERDANTURF\n"
"BATTLE TENT challenge?$"
msgstr ""
"你要挑战\n"
"绿荫镇对战帐篷吗？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:130
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainVerdanturfTent"
msgid ""
"In the VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT,\n"
"there is one crucial rule that must\l"
"be obeyed.\p"
"TRAINERS are permitted only to switch\n"
"their POKéMON in and out.\p"
"TRAINERS are otherwise forbidden to\n"
"command their POKéMON.\p"
"The POKéMON are to behave according\n"
"to their nature and battle on their own.\p"
"You must put your trust in your\n"
"POKéMON and watch over them.\p"
"If you achieve the honor of beating\n"
"three TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with a prize.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"在绿荫镇对战帐篷，\n"
"有一条必须遵守的重要规则。\p"
"训练家只能\n"
"交换宝可梦。\p"
"除此之外，训练家\n"
"不得向宝可梦下达指令。\p"
"宝可梦会按照自己的性格\n"
"自行战斗。\p"
"你必须信任你的宝可梦，\n"
"在一旁守护它们。\p"
"如果能光荣地连续打败\n"
"3位训练家，\l"
"我们会送你一份奖品。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:150
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReturnFortified"
msgid ""
"When you have fortified your heart\n"
"and POKéMON, you must return.$"
msgstr ""
"等你和宝可梦的心都\n"
"变得更坚强之后，再回来吧。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:155
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"There are two levels of difficulty,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice of a challenge?$"
msgstr ""
"难度有两种：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要挑战哪一种？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:160
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for the challenge.\p"
"To enter, you must provide three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"They also must not be holding\n"
"the same kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\p"
"Come back when you have made\n"
"your preparations.$"
msgstr ""
"唉……\p"
"你没有挑战所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"要参加挑战，必须带上\n"
"3只不同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}不能参加。\p"
"准备好之后再来吧。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:172
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for the challenge.\p"
"To enter, you must provide three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"They also must not be holding\n"
"the same kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1} ineligible.\p"
"Come back when you have made\n"
"your preparations.$"
msgstr ""
"唉……\p"
"你没有挑战所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"要参加挑战，必须带上\n"
"3只不同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}不能参加。\p"
"准备好之后再来吧。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:184
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Good. Now, you must select your\n"
"three POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"好。现在，请选择\n"
"你的3只宝可梦。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:188
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_SaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"I must save before I show you to\n"
"the BATTLE TENT. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"带你去对战帐篷之前，\n"
"我必须先记录。可以吗？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:192
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_NowFollowMe"
msgid ""
"Good.\n"
"Now, follow me.$"
msgstr ""
"好。\n"
"现在，请跟我来。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:196
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ResultsWillBeRecorded"
msgid ""
"I feel privileged for having seen\n"
"your POKéMON's exploits.\p"
"The results will be recorded.\n"
"I must ask you to briefly wait.$"
msgstr ""
"能见证你的宝可梦的表现，\n"
"我深感荣幸。\p"
"成绩将会被记录下来。\n"
"请稍候片刻。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:202
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_AchievedThreeWinStreak"
msgid ""
"To achieve a 3-win streak…\p"
"The bonds that bind your heart with\n"
"your POKéMON seem firm and true.$"
msgstr ""
"取得了3连胜……\p"
"你和宝可梦之间的羁绊\n"
"看来坚定而真挚。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:207
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_FeatWillBeRecorded"
msgid ""
"Your feat will be recorded.\n"
"I must ask you to briefly wait.$"
msgstr ""
"你的成绩将会被记录下来。\n"
"请稍候片刻。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:211
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_PresentYouWithPrize"
msgid ""
"For the feat of your 3-win streak,\n"
"we present you with this prize.$"
msgstr ""
"为了表彰你的3连胜，\n"
"我们将这份奖品送给你。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:215
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattleTent"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the BATTLE TENT\n"
"SLATEPORT SITE!\p"
"I am your guide to the Battle Swap\n"
"Tournament.$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到对战帐篷凯那市分馆！\p"
"我是交换对战大赛的向导。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:221
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_TakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the Battle\n"
"Swap challenge?$"
msgstr ""
"你要挑战\n"
"交换对战吗？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:225
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainSlateportTent"
msgid ""
"Here at the SLATEPORT BATTLE TENT,\n"
"we hold Battle Swap events\l"
"using rental POKéMON.\p"
"First, you will be loaned three\n"
"POKéMON specifically for this event.\p"
"Using the supplied rental POKéMON,\n"
"you must conduct a SINGLE BATTLE.\p"
"If you win, you are permitted to trade\n"
"one of your rental POKéMON.\p"
"Repeat this cycle of battling and\n"
"trading--if you win three times in\l"
"a row, you will earn a fine prize.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"在凯那市对战帐篷，\n"
"我们举办的是使用\l"
"租借宝可梦的交换对战。\p"
"首先，我们会专门为这次比赛\n"
"借给你3只宝可梦。\p"
"你要用借来的宝可梦\n"
"进行单打对战。\p"
"如果获胜，你就可以\n"
"交换1只租借宝可梦。\p"
"不断重复对战和交换——\n"
"如果能取得3连胜，\l"
"就能获得很棒的奖品。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:243
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_LookForwardToNextVisit"
msgid "We look forward to your next visit.$"
msgstr "期待你的再次光临。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:247
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"Which level do you wish to challenge?\n"
"Level 50 or Level 100?$"
msgstr ""
"你要挑战哪个等级？\n"
"Lv.50还是Lv.100？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:251
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_SaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Before you begin your challenge,\n"
"I need to save data. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"开始挑战之前，\n"
"我需要记录数据。可以吗？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:256
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_HoldMonsForSafekeeping"
msgid ""
"Okay, I will hold your POKéMON for\n"
"safekeeping while you compete.$"
msgstr ""
"好的，在你比赛期间，\n"
"我会替你保管你的宝可梦。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:260
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_StepThisWay"
msgid "Please step this way.$"
msgstr "请往这边走。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:263
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReturnRentalMonsSaveResults"
msgid ""
"Thank you for participating!\p"
"I will return your POKéMON in exchange\n"
"for our rental POKéMON.\p"
"I must also save your event results.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你的参与！\p"
"请归还租借宝可梦，\n"
"我会把你的宝可梦还给你。\p"
"我还要记录你的比赛成绩。\n"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:271
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReturnMonsExchangeRentals"
msgid ""
"I will return your POKéMON in exchange\n"
"for our rental POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"请归还租借宝可梦，\n"
"我会把你的宝可梦还给你。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:275
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_WonThreeMatchesReturnMons"
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You've won three straight matches!\p"
"I will return your POKéMON in exchange\n"
"for our rental POKéMON.\p"
"I must also save your event results.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！\n"
"你取得了3连胜！\p"
"请归还租借宝可梦，\n"
"我会把你的宝可梦还给你。\p"
"我还要记录你的比赛成绩。\n"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:283
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_AwardYouThisPrize"
msgid ""
"In recognition of your 3-win streak,\n"
"we award you this prize.$"
msgstr ""
"为了表彰你的3连胜，\n"
"我们将这份奖品颁发给你。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:287
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_NoRoomInBagMakeRoom"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"You seem to have no room for this.\p"
"Please make room in your BAG and\n"
"let me know.$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你好像没有地方放这个了。\p"
"请在背包里腾出空间\n"
"再来告诉我。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:293
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_BeenWaitingForYou"
msgid ""
"We've been waiting for you!\p"
"Before we resume your challenge,\n"
"I must save the game.$"
msgstr ""
"我们一直在等你！\p"
"继续挑战之前，\n"
"我必须先记录游戏进度。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:298
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say this, but you didn't\n"
"save before you quit playing last time.\p"
"As a result, you have been disqualified\n"
"from your challenge.$"
msgstr ""
"很遗憾地告诉你，你上次\n"
"结束游戏前没有记录。\p"
"因此，你的挑战资格\n"
"被取消了。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:305
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReturnPersonalMons"
msgid "We'll return your personal POKéMON.$"
msgstr "我们会把你自己的宝可梦还给你。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:309
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReceivedPrize"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了奖品\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:314
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The Battle Swap rules are listed.$"
msgstr "这里列出了交换对战的规则。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:318
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "要阅读哪一项呢？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:321
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainBasicRules"
msgid ""
"In a Battle Swap event, you may use\n"
"only three POKéMON.\p"
"Whether you are renting or swapping,\n"
"your team may not have two or more\l"
"of the same POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"在交换对战中，\n"
"只能使用3只宝可梦。\p"
"无论是租借还是交换，\n"
"你的队伍中都不能有\l"
"2只以上相同的宝可梦。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:328
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainSwapPartnerRules"
msgid ""
"You may swap POKéMON only with\n"
"the TRAINER you have just defeated.\p"
"You may swap for only those POKéMON\n"
"used by the beaten TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""
"只能和刚刚打败的\n"
"训练家交换宝可梦。\p"
"能换来的，只有被打败的\n"
"训练家使用过的宝可梦。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:334
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainSwapNumberRules"
msgid ""
"After every battle you win, you may\n"
"swap for one of your defeated\l"
"opponent's POKéMON.\p"
"You will not be able to swap POKéMON\n"
"with the third TRAINER in the event.$"
msgstr ""
"每赢一场对战，就可以从\n"
"被打败的对手的宝可梦中\l"
"换来1只。\p"
"和比赛中的第3位训练家\n"
"不能交换宝可梦。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:341
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainSwapNotes"
msgid ""
"There are two key points to be aware\n"
"of when swapping POKéMON.\p"
"First, when swapping, you can't check\n"
"the stats of the POKéMON you are\l"
"about to receive.\p"
"Second, the POKéMON on your team\n"
"are lined up in sequence, depending on\l"
"the order in which you rented them.\p"
"This sequence remains unchanged\n"
"even when swaps are made.$"
msgstr ""
"交换宝可梦时，\n"
"有两点需要注意。\p"
"第一，交换时无法查看\n"
"即将得到的宝可梦的能力。\p"
"第二，队伍中的宝可梦\n"
"会按照租借的顺序排列。\p"
"即使进行了交换，\n"
"这个顺序也不会改变。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:353
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainMonRules"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON of the SLATEPORT\n"
"BATTLE TENT are all rentals.\p"
"All rental POKéMON are kept at\n"
"Level 30.$"
msgstr ""
"凯那市对战帐篷的宝可梦\n"
"全部都是租借的。\p"
"所有租借宝可梦的等级\n"
"都固定为Lv.30。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:360
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_RulesAreListed2"
msgid ""
"The VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT\n"
"rules are listed.$"
msgstr ""
"这里列出了\n"
"绿荫镇对战帐篷的规则。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:365
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "要阅读哪一项呢？$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:369
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainBasicRules"
msgid ""
"Here at the VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT,\n"
"POKéMON are required to think and\l"
"battle by themselves.\p"
"Unlike in the wild, POKéMON that live\n"
"with people behave differently\l"
"depending on their nature.$"
msgstr ""
"在绿荫镇对战帐篷，\n"
"宝可梦需要自己思考、\l"
"自己战斗。\p"
"和野生的不同，和人一起生活的\n"
"宝可梦会根据性格\l"
"表现出不同的行为。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:378
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainNatureRules"
msgid ""
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON\n"
"may prefer to attack no matter what.\p"
"Another POKéMON may prefer to protect\n"
"itself from any harm.\p"
"Yet another may enjoy vexing or\n"
"confounding its foes.\p"
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON\n"
"will have favorite moves that it is good\l"
"at using.\p"
"It may also dislike certain moves that\n"
"it has trouble using.$"
msgstr ""
"根据性格的不同，有的宝可梦\n"
"无论如何都喜欢进攻。\p"
"有的宝可梦则喜欢\n"
"保护自己免受伤害。\p"
"还有的宝可梦喜欢\n"
"扰乱或迷惑对手。\p"
"根据性格的不同，宝可梦\n"
"会有自己擅长使用的\l"
"喜欢的招式。\p"
"也可能会有不擅长使用的\n"
"讨厌的招式。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:392
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainMoveRules"
msgid ""
"There are offensive moves that inflict\n"
"direct damage on the foe.\p"
"There are defensive moves that are\n"
"used to prepare for enemy attacks or\l"
"used to heal HP and so on.\p"
"There are also other somewhat-odd\n"
"moves that may enfeeble the foes with\l"
"stat problems including poison and \l"
"paralysis.\p"
"POKéMON will consider using moves in\n"
"these three categories.$"
msgstr ""
"有直接对对手\n"
"造成伤害的攻击招式。\p"
"有用来防备对手攻击\n"
"或回复HP等的防守招式。\p"
"还有一些比较特别的招式，\n"
"能让对手陷入中毒、\l"
"麻痹等异常状态而变弱。\p"
"宝可梦会考虑使用\n"
"这三类招式。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:406
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainUnderpoweredRules"
msgid ""
"When not under command by its TRAINER,\n"
"a POKéMON may be unable to effectively\l"
"use certain moves.\p"
"A POKéMON is not good at using any\n"
"move that it dislikes.\p"
"If a POKéMON only knows moves that\n"
"do not match its nature, it will often\l"
"be unable to live up to its potential.$"
msgstr ""
"没有训练家的指令时，\n"
"宝可梦可能无法\l"
"有效地使用某些招式。\p"
"宝可梦不擅长使用\n"
"自己讨厌的招式。\p"
"如果宝可梦只会和自己性格\n"
"不合的招式，\l"
"就常常无法发挥出真正的实力。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:417
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainWhenInDangerRules"
msgid ""
"Depending on its nature, a POKéMON may\n"
"start using moves that don't match its\l"
"nature when it is in trouble.\p"
"If a POKéMON begins behaving oddly\n"
"in a pinch, watch it carefully.$"
msgstr ""
"根据性格的不同，有的宝可梦\n"
"在陷入危机时，\l"
"会开始使用和性格不合的招式。\p"
"如果宝可梦在危急时刻\n"
"表现得很奇怪，\l"
"请仔细观察它。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:424
msgctxt "BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainLevelRules"
msgid ""
"At this BATTLE TENT, the levels of\n"
"your opponents will be adjusted to\l"
"match the levels of your POKéMON.\p"
"However, no TRAINER you face will\n"
"have any POKéMON below Level 30.$"
msgstr ""
"在这个对战帐篷，\n"
"对手的等级会根据\l"
"你的宝可梦的等级进行调整。\p"
"不过，你遇到的训练家的宝可梦\n"
"等级都不会低于Lv.30。$"

#: data/text/battle_tent.inc:431
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid ""
"The VERDANTURF BATTLE TENT\n"
"rules are listed.$"
msgstr ""
"这里列出了\n"
"绿荫镇对战帐篷的规则。$"
